Subject: [REVIEW 05/09] Qualcomm router and DisplayPort provider

Add the Glymur router frontend, firmware/MCU control, NHI transport, startup, events, Type-C handling and DP provider. Review probe failures, release/restart, asynchronous work and the public display contract.

Dependencies: Patches 01-04; patches 06-07 complete the coupled display integration. Apply the complete series before building.

Source attribution: Local Surface integration; provenance/usb4/22-usb4-glymur-host-router-frontend.patch and the later source sequence recorded in provenance/derivation.json. The retained local diffs do not identify authors per hunk.

This is a review grouping of preserved source, not a new authorship claim or
an independently build-validated upstream commit. Original attribution remains
in the referenced provenance files. No new Signed-off-by trailers are added.

---
